title: Peace Movement
subtitle: Work for an end to the conflict.
is-card: true
tags: caucus_affairs
card-image: img/card_peace.svg
view-if: peace_timer <= 0 and (war or dooku_movement) and cardok_peace
on-arrival: turn_actions += 1; peace_timer = 2; last_card_timer = "peace"
new-page: true

= Peace Movement

[? if war : Every month of war costs a million lives and a little more of the Republic's soul. ?][? if not war : The Separatist crisis grows. Is it too late for dialogue? ?] Our channels to the Separatists are [+ peace_talks +]/3 established.

- @rallies: Organise peace rallies across the Core.
- @channel: Open a channel to Separatist moderates.
- @corridors: Negotiate humanitarian corridors.
- @compact: Table a Federal Compact in the Senate.
- @easy_discard

@rallies
subtitle: Calms fear and the Pacifists; the Hawks are irritated.
on-arrival: pacifist_dissent -= 6; faith += 1; fear -= 2; hawk_dissent += 3; war_weariness -= 1

Millions march on Coruscant. [? if rc_chancellor : The Security Bloc calls them "well-meaning but naive". ?][? if not rc_chancellor : The Chancellery calls them "well-meaning but naive". ?]

@channel
view-if: peace_talks < 3
subtitle: −1 political capital. Builds the path to a negotiated peace.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: capital -= 1; peace_talks += 1; cis_relation += 5; sec_relation -= 4; hawk_dissent += 3

Through neutral Mandalorian intermediaries, a message reaches the Separatist Parliament on Raxus. Someone answers.

@corridors
view-if: war
subtitle: −1 political capital. Less hardship and war-weariness.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: capital -= 1; rim_hardship -= 2; war_weariness -= 3; faith += 0.5

Medical frigates under neutral flags begin to reach the worst-hit worlds.

@compact
view-if: peace_talks >= 3 and not rc_in_govt
subtitle: −2 political capital. From the opposition benches, the Caucus proposes a reformed Republic in which the seceded worlds could live. Needs a Senate majority.
choose-if: capital >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Needs 2 political capital.
on-arrival: {! Q.capital -= 2; SW.federalCompact(Q); if (Q.federal_compact) this.achieve('federal_compact'); !}

[+ vote_html +]

[? if federal_compact : The Senate approves the Federal Compact. Seceded worlds may return with guarantees of autonomy, fair representation and an end to guild monopolies. Within weeks, system after system lowers the Confederate flag. The guns fall silent. ?][? if fc_sabotaged : The Senate approves the Compact, but on the night it is to be signed, a bomb destroys the Separatist delegation's ship. Each side blames the other. The war resumes, more bitter than before. Someone did not want peace. ?][? if not fc_passed and not vote_tabled : The Compact fails on the floor. The Chancellor's allies call it "surrender with a ribbon on it". ?]
